---

<Layout title="The Employer of Record Operating Brief | Trustora" description="Request Trustora’s flagship brief for hiring specialist technical and scientific talent across borders." currentPath="/eor-brief/" darkHeader conversion>
  <section class="conversion-page brief-squeeze-page"><div class="measure conversion-grid"><div class="conversion-copy"><SectionLabel light>Trustora flagship brief</SectionLabel><h1>Build the employment layer behind frontier work.</h1><p>The Employer of Record with Employee Intelligence brief is a practical guide to employing AI, ML, quantum, physics, science, engineering, and software professionals across the EU, Australia, and USA.</p><ul class="conversion-list"><li>Why EoR matters for specialist teams</li><li>EoR versus entity, PEO, and contractor models</li><li>USA–EU–Australia operating questions</li><li>Employee experience and payroll trust checklist</li><li>30-day readiness conversation</li><li>Trustora’s boundaries and next steps</li></ul></div><div class="conversion-panel"><h2>Request the brief.</h2><p>Tell us what you are trying to employ. We will send the working material and use your context to make the next conversation useful.</p><form class="form-stack" action="mailto:info@trustora.net" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><Field id="name" label="Your name" required placeholder="Your name" /><Field id="email" label="Work email" type="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" /><Field id="company" label="Company" required placeholder="Company name" /><div class="field"><label for="region">Primary region</label><select id="region" name="region"><option>European Union</option><option>Australia</option><option>United States</option><option>More than one region</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="domain">Technical or scientific domain</label><select id="domain" name="domain"><option>AI / machine learning</option><option>Quantum</option><option>Physics / applied sciences</option><option>Software / product engineering</option><option>Other specialist capability</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="brief-context">What are you trying to do?</label><textarea id="brief-context" name="context" placeholder="Country, role, timing, or question."></textarea></div><p class="form-note">Please do not include sensitive personal information. This brief is an operational starting point, not legal, tax, immigration, or employment advice.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Request the brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></form></div></div><p class="conversion-footnote">Prefer to start without a form? <a href="/briefings/employer-of-record-operating-brief/">Read the brief overview</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact Trustora</a>.</p></section>
</Layout>
